# stage_05 (the sixth battle, won hands-off: the computer runs the whole
# lance) with upgrade_lance_weapons on, so the lance's 'Mechs fire the weapon each
# priority entry is meant to fire.
# Enemies take the original's path (tests/test_lance_ai.cpp). In this
# battle no choice of the lance's changes, so the frames match stage_05's.
# upgrades: lance_weapons
# set: campaign
# start-save: REVENGE_SAVE_STAGE_04
# Load Game, slot 1 (as old_save.keys); the story to the choice of plans.
idle:1000 Return idle:50 Right idle:50 Return idle:300
Return idle:600 @snap:stage5_story1
Return idle:600 @snap:stage5_story2
Return idle:600 @snap:stage5_story3
Return idle:600 @snap:stage5_story4
Return idle:600 @snap:stage5_story5
Return idle:600 @snap:stage5_plans                 # the choice of two plans
# The first plan (through the forest), highlighted; its briefing; the battle (SCENE6)
# from 07:12, won hands-off at 07:14, each message answered when it is up.
Return idle:600 @snap:stage5_briefing
Return steps:4 @snap:stage5_battle
still:2000 @snap:stage5_message1 Return
still:2000 @snap:stage5_message2 Return
still:2000 @snap:stage5_won Return
# A transmission that waits for a key (Return; Down does not close it), then
# the menu over it: Save & Continue to slot 1.
still:2000 @snap:stage5_after
Return idle:300 @snap:stage5_menu
Down idle:50 Down idle:50 @snap:stage5_save         # Save & Continue highlighted
Return idle:300 @snap:stage5_slots
Return idle:300 @snap:stage5_save1 Return idle:300 @snap:stage5_save2
# Saved; stage 6 (SCENE8) starts at once, its battle running: its fourth step.
Return steps:4 @snap:stage5_saved
